    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "THE COMPANY WILL APPRECIATE SUGGESTIONS FROM ITS PATRONS CONCERNING ITS SERVICE\n1201-S\nCLASS OF SERVICE\nWESTERN\nThis is a full-rate\nTelegram\nor Cable-\ngram\nunless its de-\nferred character is in-\ndicated by a suitable\nsign above or preced-\ning the address.\nR. B. WHITE\nUNION\nSIGNS\nDI\nter\nNM\n07 essage\nNI\neter\nLC = Deferred Cable\nNLT = Cable Night Letter\nShip Radiogram\nJ. C. WILLEVER\nPRESIDENT\nCHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD\nFIRST VICE-PRESIDENT\nThe filing time as shown in the date line on full-rate telegrams and day letters, and the time of receipt at destination as shown on all messages, is STANDARD TIME.\nReceived at 17 South 4th Avenue, Mt. Vernon, N. Y.\n1934 JAN 19 AM 7 08\nNQ2 44 NL=LOSANGELES CALIF 18\nMINUTES IN TRANSIT\nFULL-RATE\nDAY LETTER\nNRS HM BIXBY. CARE WHITTEMORE=\n19 TANGLEWILDE AVE BRONXVILLE NY=\nPLEASE WIRE ME ONE HUNDRED DOLLARS AMBASSADOR HOTEL LEAVING\nHERE SATURDAY MORNING ARRIVE STLOUIS SUNDAY NOON ARRIVE\nNEWARK TUESDAY NOON VIA TWA THIS SCHEDULE WILL GIVE ME\nSUNDAY AFTERNOON AND ALL DY MONDAY IN STLOUIS STOP FEELING\nFINE AWFULLY EXCITED ABOUT BEING HOME LOVE=\nHAD.\nND SAFEST WAY TO SEND MO\nLET US\nSEND THAT\nMONEY\nFOR YOU\nSafely\nQuickly\nEasily\nby\nWESTERN UNION\nMoney Order Service\nNO Loss of Time\nNO Danger of Robbery\nNO Loss of Interest\n$.\n. can be sent\nto\nLosAnseles\n-in an\nhour or so for only 5.2 6/\nFor only a few cents more you can\nsend a message with the money.\n8250-B"
